ty of Veterinary Medicine (UCVM) in 2023. She then completed a small animal rotating internship at Red Bank Veterinary Hospital in New Jersey.\nSee More\nTucker Graham, DVM\nBio coming soon!\nSee More\nMichael Karagiannis, DVM, DACVECC\nDiplomate, American College of Veterinary Emergency & Critical Care\nDr.\nSee More\nRebecca Greer, DVM, MS, DACVECC\nDiplomate, American College of Veterinary Emergency & Critical Care\nSee More\nRobyn Sherman, DVM, DACVECC\nDiplomate, American College of Veterinary Emergency & Critical Care\nDr. Sherman joined VSS on May 20, 2013 as an emergency and critical care veterinarian.\nSee More\nBlake Sutton, DVM, DAVECC\nDiplomate, American College of Veterinary Emergency & Critical Care\nBlake Sutton, DVM, DACVECC is part of our emergency and critical care team.\nSee More\nKayla Krager, DVM\nDiplomate, American College of Veterinary Emergency & Critical Care\nSee More\nCecilia Marshall, DVM, DACVIM\nDiplomate, American College of Veterinary Internal Medicine (Cardiology)\nDr. Cecilia Marshall was raised in St. Louis and attended veterinary school at the University of Missouri.\nSee More\nAshley Anderson, DVM\nDr. Anderson is originally from Texas and grew up outside of the Houston area. She attended Texas A&M for undergrad and continue to be a diehard Aggie Football fan. Dr.\nSee More\nJenny Howard, DVM, MS, DACVIM\nDiplomate, American College of Veterinary Internal Medicine\nJenny Howard is a St.\nSee More\nRobert Nack, DVM, DABVP\nDiplomate, American Board of Veterinary Practitioners\nDr. Robert Nack is a St. Louis native. He went to undergraduate school at Truman State University and received his DVM from Mizzou in 1997.\nSee More\nTimothy Koors, DVM, DACVECC, DACVR\nA Diplomate of the American College of Veterinary Emergency and Critical Care, Dr. Koors has extensive experience in, but not limited to, the stabilization of severe traumas, intoxications, mechanical ventilation and pain management.\nSee More\nKristen O'Dell-Anderson, DVM, MS, DACVR\nDiplomate, American College of Veterinary Radiology\nSee More\nBonnie Smith, DVM, DACVIM\nDiplomate, American College of Veterinary Internal Medicine (Oncology)\nDr.\nSee More\nShirley Chu, DVM, PhD, DACVIM\nDiplomate, American College of Veterinary Internal Medicine (Oncology)\nSee More\nShelby Mancini, DVM, DACVIM\nDiplomate, American College of Veterinary Internal Medicine (Neurology)\nIn 2013, Dr.\nSee More\nVisit our hospitals for the latest in top-quality veterinary care and unparalleled service.\nfacebook\ninstagram\nLinks\nContact Us\nPrivacy\nAccessibility\nVSS (Manchester)\nAddress:\n1021 Howard George Drive, Manchester, MO 63021\nReferral Line:\n(636) 227-9400\nEmergency Line:\n(636)-227-6100\nEmail:\n[email protected]\nVSS - West (O'Fallon)\nAddress:\n7770 Winghaven Blvd, O'Fallon, MO 63368\nReferral Line:\n(636) 244-9004\nEmergency Line:\n(636)-244-8999\nEmail:\n[email protected]\nX\nVeterinary Specialty Services\nVeterinary Specialty Services - WEST\n©2026 Veterinary Specialty Services. Resource Articles ©2026 GeniusVets. All Rights Reserved.\nVeterinary websites by GeniusVets",
